<title>ZAMBIA: Bomb scare disrupts Zambia central bank operations.</title>
<headline>Bomb scare disrupts Zambia central bank operations.</headline>
<dateline>LUSAKA 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Operations at Zambia's central bank were  suspended for close to two hours on Friday after an anonymous caller  warned that a bomb had been planted on the premises.</p>
<p>Over 500 workers were evacuated but no bomb was found and normal operations  resumed late on Friday afternoon.</p>
<p>Police said they had not established who was behind the scare.</p>
<p>-- Lusaka newsroom, +26 01 222-689</p>
</text>
